      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are experiencing a deep sense of burnout and exhaustion from dedicating so many years to your work. This feeling of emptiness is a common emotional response when one's primary source of identity and energy dries up, but it's important to know that it doesn't mean you are merely a shell forever. Just as a blank canvas isn't empty of potential, so too can a person find new purpose by slowing down, exploring interests outside of your career, and allowing yourself to rest without guilt.",
